1a) Why does an arrival event need to generate a new arrival
 event?
 - An arrival event represents a new customer entering the system.
 When a customer arrives the simulator needs to schedule the
 next arrival event so that another customer can arrive later.

 1b) Which event should be generated by the start of the service?
 - When the service of a customer starts a departure event should
 be generated. This event represents the moment when the customer
 finishes being served and leaves the system.